       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SPIKE-COUNT-SOLID.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I BINARY-LONG.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-COLUMN.
          05 LS-STATE BINARY-SHORT UNSIGNED OCCURS 98304.
       01 LS-COUNT BINARY-LONG.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-COLUMN LS-COUNT.
           MOVE 0 TO LS-COUNT
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 98304
              IF LS-STATE(WS-I) NOT = 0
                 ADD 1 TO LS-COUNT
              END-IF
              MOVE 2 TO LS-STATE(WS-I)
           END-PERFORM
           GOBACK.
